mx-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-primary/15 border border-primary/25 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield w-5 h-5 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg></div><h1 class=\"text-2xl font-display font-bold text-white\">SecureIT</h1></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><a class=\"text-text-muted hover:text-white transition-colors text-sm font-medium\" href=\"/login\">Entrar</a><a class=\"bg-primary text-white px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-bold hover:bg-primary-hover shadow-lg shadow-primary/20 transition-all\" href=\"/signup\">Criar Conta</a></div></nav><section class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8 pt-32 pb-32 text-center\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 text-primary text-sm font-medium mb-8\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg>Protecao Inteligente</div><h2 class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl font-display font-bold text-white leading-tight\">Seguranca inteligente<br/><span class=\"text-primary\">para sua casa</span></h2><p class=\"mt-6 text-lg text-text-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">Sistema de monitorizacao com reconhecimento facial e deteccao de pessoas. Receba alertas em tempo real e proteja o que mais importa.</p><div class=\"mt-10 flex items-center justify-center gap-4\"><a class=\"bg-primary text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold text-base hover:bg-primary-hover shadow-lg shadow-primary/20 transition-all inline-flex items-center gap-2\" href=\"/signup\">Comecar Agora<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"#features\" class=\"border border-border text-text-muted px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold text-base hover:bg-surface-hover hover:text-white transition-all\">Saber Mais</a></div></section><section id=\"features\" class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8 py-24\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-4\">Funcionalidades</h3><p class=\"text-text-muted max-w-lg mx-auto\">Tudo o que precisa para manter a sua casa segura</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"group p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-primary/30 transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/15 border border-primary/25 flex items-center justify-center mb-5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-eye w-6 h-6 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><h4 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3\">Reconhecimento Facial</h4><p class=\"text-text-muted leading-relaxed\">Identifique automaticamente pessoas conhecidas e desconhecidas nas suas cameras.</p></div><div class=\"group p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-primary/30 transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/15 border border-primary/25 flex items-center justify-center mb-5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield w-6 h-6 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg></div><h4 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3\">Deteccao de Pessoas</h4><p class=\"text-text-muted leading-relaxed\">YOLOv11 detecta pessoas em tempo real com alta precisao e baixa latencia.</p></div><div class=\"group p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-primary/30 transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary/15 border border-primary/25 flex items-center justify-center mb-5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bell w-6 h-6 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.268 21a2 2 0 0 0 3.464 0\"></path><path d=\"M3.262 15.326A1 1 0 0 0 4 17h16a1 1 0 0 0 .74-1.673C19.41 13.956 18 12.499 18 8A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 4.499-1.411 5.956-2.738 7.326\"></path></svg></div><h4 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3\">Alertas em Tempo Real</h4><p class=\"text-text-muted leading-relaxed\">Receba notificacoes instantaneas quando alguem for detectado nas suas cameras.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8 py-24\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><h3 class=\"text-3xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-4\">Planos</h3><p class=\"text-text-muted max-w-lg mx-auto\">Escolha o plano ideal para as suas necessidades</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-border-light transition-all\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><h4 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-white\">Trial</h4></div><p class=\"text-text-muted mb-6\">Experimente gratuitamente durante 14 dias.</p><div class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-6\">Gratis</div><ul class=\"space-y-3 text-sm text-text-muted mb-8\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-4 h-4 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg>1 camera</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-4 h-4 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg>10 pessoas registadas</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-4 h-4 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg>Deteccao de pessoas</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-4 h-4 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg>Sem reconhecimento facial</li></ul><a class=\"block text-center border border-border text-text-muted py-3 rounded-lg font-bold hover:bg-surface-hover hover:text-white transition-all\" href=\"/signup\">Comecar Trial</a></div><div class=\"p-8 rounded-2xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/25 hover:border-primary/40 transition-all\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><h4 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-white\">Standard</h4><span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-primary/20 text-primary text-xs font-semibold\">Popular</span></div><p class=\"text-text-muted mb-6\">Acesso completo a todas as funcionalidades.</p><div class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-6\">Sob consulta</div><ul class=\"space-y-3 text-sm text-text-muted mb-8\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-4 h-4 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg>Cameras ilimitadas</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-4 h-4 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg>Pessoas ilimitadas</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-4 h-4 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg>Deteccao de pessoas</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-4 h-4 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg>Reconhecimento facial</li></ul><a class=\"block text-center bg-primary text-white py-3 rounded-lg font-bold hover:bg-primary-hover shadow-lg shadow-primary/20 transition-all\" href=\"/signup\">Contactar</a></div></div></section><footer class=\"border-t border-border py-12 px-8\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield w-4 h-4 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-text-muted text-sm\">© 2026 SecureIT. Todos os direitos reservados.</p></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-6 text-sm text-text-muted\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Termos</a><a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Privacidade</a></div></div></footer></div><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3-cvi9n85pdi7.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[59385,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0u8fe5v6xf6ku.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2zp5z71wuczix.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[4675,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0u8fe5v6xf6ku.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2zp5